cff-version: 1.2.0
title: news-digest-agent
authors:
  - alias: jennymaeleidig
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-09-13"
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/jennymaeleidig/news-digest-agent"
abstract: >-
  A personal source log that publishes RSS feeds. sources.toml is
  the registry — 20 sources subscribed directly in a reader app,
  6 published here: arXiv filtered to the LLM/software-engineering
  subset, Hugging Face Daily Papers, two Reddits, and the Richmond
  Times-Dispatch. The published site is the store: each hourly run
  merges fresh fetches against the live feed, failures re-emit the
  predecessor byte-stable, and no API keys are involved.
